Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: No Traces Appearing
Symptoms: Jaeger UI shows no traces despite generating traffic

Solutions:

Check if services are properly injected with sidecars:
oc get pods -n bookinfo-tracing -o jsonpath='{.items[*].spec.containers[*].name}'
Verify Jaeger agent connectivity:
oc logs -n bookinfo-tracing deployment/productpage-v1 -c istio-proxy | grep jaeger
Check sampling configuration:
oc get configmap istio -n istio-system -o yaml | grep -A 10 defaultConfig
Issue 2: Incomplete Traces
Symptoms: Traces show only some services, missing spans

Solutions:

Ensure all services have proper headers propagation
Check for network policies blocking communication
Verify service mesh member roll includes all namespaces
Issue 3: High Latency in Jaeger UI
Symptoms: Jaeger UI is slow to load traces

Solutions:

Reduce trace retention period
Implement proper sampling strategies
Scale Jaeger components if needed
